    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21646" root="شبه" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبَاهٌ</span></b>  (Lth, JK, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُبَاهٌ</span> (CK [but not in
my MS. copy of the K nor in the TA]) <i>A certain
grain, like that called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُرْف</span> (Lth, JK, K) <i>in
colour,</i> [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُرْفٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشَادٌ</span>,] <i>which is taken,</i> i. e.
<i>swallowed, as a medicine.</i> (Lth, JK.)

